<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><em>In days gone by, people judged you by your shoes, today they judge you
by your website.</em></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">How many potential customers or clients have you lost, because your website wasn&#8217;t up to scratch? There&#8217;s nothing worse than having an outdated website, a website that is difficult to navigate, or a website that isn&#8217;t mobile phone friendly. These are the three common issues potential customers complain about when they visit websites.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It’s important to remember, your website is a reflection of you and your
business; it&#8217;s like a window to your brand. It’s vital you keep your website up
to date; because an outdated website can really do more harm than good.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Five benefits a good website can achieve.</p>



<ol class="wp-block-list"><li>Reach new
customers.</li><li>Build brand
awareness</li><li>Local, national and
global reach. </li><li>Works for you 24/7.</li><li>Two-way
communication between you and your customers.</li></ol>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><em>“Is it time to spend a little&#8230; and buy a new pair of shoes?”</em></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you’re ready to step up…<strong> <a href="/">Ad On Group</a></strong> can create a brand new website, or update your existing website. And it won&#8217;t cost you an arm and a leg. When we build your new website, we provide a HOLISTIC approach and offer you UNIQUE advantages. You’ll receive a number of <strong>VALUABLE EXTRAS. </strong>They include: &nbsp;</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Google SEO (search
engine optimization) </li><li>Traffic Analysis of
your website</li><li>Quarterly Updates
of your business</li><li>Animated Video to
be featured on your website,&nbsp;showcasing your business.&nbsp;</li></ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">You’ll be more than impressed with the final result. And, you’ll love
the STYLISH modern design, eye-catching graphics, and unrivalled functionality.
</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><a href="/">Ad On Group</a></strong><a href="/"> </a>offers affordable website design and maintenance packages. You’ll also have direct access to our advertising and marketing professionals, who’ll take a genuine interest in you and your business.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For more details and to view samples of the websites we have already created, click to: <a href="/">www.adongroup.com.au</a>. </p>
